			"statement": "Écris $A$ sous la forme $e^{\\cdots}$, l'exposant étant réduit.\n\n$A=\\dfrac{\\left(e^{ {{eval:a*x}} }\\right)^{ {{n}} }\\times e^{ {{eval:b*x+c}} }}{e^{ {{eval:d*x+f}} }}$\n\n$A=?$",
			"variables": [
				{
					"name": "x",
					"expression": "x|x"
				},
				{
					"name": "a",
					"expression": "1..3;±"
				},
				{
					"name": "n",
					"expression": "2..3"
				},
				{
					"name": "b",
					"expression": "1..4;±"
